# =============================================================================
# Payment - Storefront Payment Intents API Smoke Tests
# =============================================================================

### Create payment intent – no auth (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/storefront/paying/create-intent
Authorization: Bearer {{storeToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "orderId": "{{nonExistentId}}"
}

### List payment methods – no auth (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/storefront/paying/methods

### List payment methods – success (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/storefront/paying/methods
Authorization: Bearer {{storeToken}}
